# 9. Service de messages initial

Chemin :

```text
src/main/java/fr/olympicraft/message/MessageService.java
```

```java
package fr.olympicraft.message;

import fr.olympicraft.internal.BuildDefaults;
import net.minecraft.commands.CommandSourceStack;
import net.minecraft.network.chat.Component;
import net.minecraft.network.chat.MutableComponent;

public final class MessageService {

    public Component prefixed(String message) {
        return Component.literal(
                BuildDefaults.MESSAGE_PREFIX + message
        );
    }

    public Component success(String message) {
        return prefixed("§a" + message);
    }

    public Component warning(String message) {
        return prefixed("§e" + message);
    }

    public Component error(String message) {
        return prefixed("§c" + message);
    }

    public Component info(String message) {
        return prefixed("§7" + message);
    }

    public void sendSuccess(
            CommandSourceStack source,
            String message
    ) {
        source.sendSuccess(
                () -> success(message),
                false
        );
    }

    public void sendWarning(
            CommandSourceStack source,
            String message
    ) {
        source.sendSuccess(
                () -> warning(message),
                false
        );
    }

    public void sendError(
            CommandSourceStack source,
            String message
    ) {
        source.sendFailure(error(message));
    }

    public void sendInfo(
            CommandSourceStack source,
            String message
    ) {
        source.sendSuccess(
                () -> info(message),
                false
        );
    }

    public MutableComponent commandHeader() {
        return Component.literal(
                "§8§m---------------- §b§lOlympicraft §8§m----------------"
        );
    }
}
```

Ce service est volontairement simple dans la première étape. Il sera ensuite relié à :

```text
config/olympicraft/messages.json5
```

Les chaînes ne resteront donc pas inscrites en dur.

